  data:
    name: Use Meshes Compression
    description: "<b>\u2022 What It Does:</b> Optimizes vertex data for meshes, reducing
      file size and memory usage.\n\n<b>\u2022 Our Modification:</b> Enabling mesh
      compression minimizes memory consumption and enhances performance by reducing
      data load. Be careful, however, as it can reduce the precision of vertex data
      and lower the visual quality of blendshapes."
